    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823650/extras/72fabc5bfe4fa1590ac76d651d76d296.poster.avif?t=1730178756\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823650/extras/72fabc5bfe4fa1590ac76d651d76d296.webm?t=1730178756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823650/extras/72fabc5bfe4fa1590ac76d651d76d296.mp4?t=1730178756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You wake up in Medical to an abandoned spacecraft.<br>You have no recollection as to who you are.<br>Where is everyone? and what happened on this ship?<br>Your journey on the EDEN-03 Cargo vessel awaits.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four Possible Endings</li><li>Authentic Original Soundtrack</li><li>Fleshed Out Story</li><li>Achievements</li><li>Easter Eggs</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823650/extras/6a9908741a4ced5c8863140798cff7d5.poster.avif?t=1730178756\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823650/extras/6a9908741a4ced5c8863140798cff7d5.apng?t=1730178756\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=109 /></picture></span>",
